  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">THE ART GALLERY</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<nav class=\"menu menu-sub-terms\" role=\"navigation\" id=\"menu-sub-terms\">\n\n\t\t\t<ul id=\"menu-sub-terms-items\" class=\"menu-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"cat-item cat-item-44\"><a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\">MEET THE ARTIST</a>\n</li>\n\t<li class=\"cat-item cat-item-43\"><a href=\"/archive/source-bc2e4bef39a39f9eb9e9/\">THE ART GALLERY ARTISTS</a>\n</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\n\t\t</nav>\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-websitemanager post-6748 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-meet-the-artist tag-vivien-oswells-bench\" id=\"post-6748\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/viviens-bench/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-equal thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"1025\" height=\"485\" alt=\"Group of people around a bench with painting.\" src=\"/media/archive/6d458e30b9d9b042227afff3c61498071e4f59167a22cb87f4454ebf06af67f1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/viviens-bench/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Vivien’s Bench</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2024-03-26T15:11:14-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, March 26, 2024, 3:11 pm\">March 26, 2024</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>On a recent sunny Saturday members of the Guild of Harwich Artists gathered in Doane Park in Harwich Port to celebrate  (age 100), a co-founding member of the Guild.  The <a href=\"/news/viviens-bench/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5752 post type-post status-publish format-video has-post-thumbnail category-meet-the-artist category-news category-zoom tag-larry-folding tag-monthly-meetings tag-zoom\" id=\"post-5752\">\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/larry-folding-demo/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Larry Folding Demo</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-dfd2582e14930d4b2c34/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Video</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-05-01T07:57:38-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, May 1, 2021, 7:57 am\">May 1, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5734\" src=\"/media/archive/9b6b9a0f8c5f6130988f7ec84e1e2c687ecfcbed898826363f24ba86889e0585.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"188\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Larry Folding gave a tour of his Harwich studio and a 1/2 hour watercolor demonstration at the April 24th General Meeting. View the meeting here using the access passcode <b>LarryFolding@421<br />\n</b></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">Meeting Recording:<b><br />\n<a href=\"https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/share/MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJasLnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://us02web.zoom.us/rec/<wbr></wbr>share/<wbr></wbr>MiczSnz4GPEXuG6fyfaaXQLi-<wbr></wbr>1k5n0SO8FmNMrGcEQT5JULPAiJfJas<wbr></wbr>LnFHxILhK.GRF-deVAvkf0L3Ca</a></b></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5710 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-5710\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/copely-society-of-art-boston/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"373\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Karen Shortsleeve recently sold Blue Hydrangeas through the Copley Society of Art in Boston.\" src=\"/media/archive/77f709d639d36f7f3d2d6a32ae83ea8ac444e72ab028bb9be6fcc2df58496e37.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/copely-society-of-art-boston/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Copely Society of Art, Boston</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-12T07:06:46-05:00\" title=\"Friday, March 12, 2021, 7:06 am\">March 12, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Karen Shortsleeve was recently accepted into the Copley Society of Art in Boston, a high honor, and has sold her first painting through them. The Copley Society of Art is <a href=\"/news/copely-society-of-art-boston/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5630 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-art-in-the-park category-education category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-art-in-the-park tag-chatham-bars-inn tag-scholarship tag-sunshine\" id=\"post-5630\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-february-2021-newsletter/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"290\" height=\"385\" alt=\"A woman with a face mask holding up greeting cards.\" src=\"/media/archive/253fa5da7f1ce51a9a90b0ca2cb94f0f37bfba6ec784a6e6cf2b9d6422a4edba.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-february-2021-newsletter/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild February 2021 Newsletter</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-02-01T17:39:55-05:00\" title=\"Monday, February 1, 2021, 5:39 pm\">February 1, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>President’s Message The GHA Board met last Monday to address multiple agenda items. The following is my outline summary of the proceedings. Please feel free to ask questions. Financial:  The <a href=\"/news/guild-february-2021-newsletter/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5390 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-5390\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/vacca-speaks-to-the-cape-cod-chronicle/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman at a desk at an art gallery.\" src=\"/media/archive/b567d6e7e51ab7122886f2b7849afb99031bb9c30e5f68c50fa4d3f228c7b92c.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/vacca-speaks-to-the-cape-cod-chronicle/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Vacca Speaks to The Cape Cod Chronicle</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-08-11T20:39:50-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, August 11, 2020, 8:39 pm\">August 11, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Cape Cod Chronicle’s Amy Tagliaferri recently stopped by The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists to speak with member Katherine Vacca. Find the full article in the <a href=\"/news/vacca-speaks-to-the-cape-cod-chronicle/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5197 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-events category-meet-the-artist category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-5197\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/the-art-gallery-opens-june-27/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"578\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of trees\" src=\"/media/archive/39a644a35a6c433539cf27b17d1f13de669dcbb0044f1c9ca7637945fc294849.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/the-art-gallery-opens-june-27/\" rel=\"bookmark\">The Art Gallery Opens Mid-April 2024</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-15T11:44:48-04:00\" title=\"Monday, June 15, 2020, 11:44 am\">June 15, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Art Gallery opens for the 2024 season in Mid-April with the works of 24 artists who live and paint on Cape Cod. Ours is a postcard life in art, <a href=\"/news/the-art-gallery-opens-june-27/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t<nav class=\"navigation pagination\" aria-label=\"Posts pagination\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"screen-reader-text\">Posts pagination</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"nav-links\"><span class=\"page-numbers current\">1</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>2</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<span class=\"page-numbers dots\">…</span>\n<a class=\"page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>11</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span>\n<a class=\"next page-numbers\" title=\"Archived control; this function is not available here\" href>Next →</a><span data-fidelity-note=\"functional\" class=\"note\"> (archived control)</span></div>\n\t</nav>\n\n\t\n",
